</div>
	<p>Failure to generate and maintain the E-Way Bill can lead to penalties and seizures of goods.</p>
	<h3>IBA-Approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty)</h3>
	<p>In addition to GST E-Way Bills, packers and movers in Surat and Jaipur must adhere to the guidelines provided by the Indian Banks' Association (IBA). IBA-approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty) serve as an essential component of the transit process.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>IBA LR/Bilty facilitates proper documentation of the consignment details, such as the description, quantity, and value of goods.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>It ensures that the consignment is safeguarded against any loss or damage during transit.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>IBA-approved LR/Bilty also confirms the agreement between the packer and mover and the recipient for the transportation of goods.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<p>When choosing a reliable packer and mover, ensure they provide IBA-approved LR/Bilty, as it proves the legitimacy of the company and ensures a secure transit for your belongings.</p>
	<h3>IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
	<p>To protect your valuable belongings from potential risks during transit, IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) Marine Transit Insurance is essential.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance covers goods in transit against damage, theft, or loss due to accidents or other unexpected events.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>It ensures that you receive compensation for the incurred damage or loss, providing peace of mind during the relocation process.</span></li>
